QuantFunc ComfyUI Plugin — License
==================================

This repository is DUAL-LICENSED. It contains two distinct kinds of artifact, each
under a different license:

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. PLUGIN SOURCE  (open)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
All Python and JavaScript SOURCE in this repository — the ComfyUI node layer,
format adapters, auto-updater, model loaders, web assets, scripts, and tutorials —
is open: it may be read, audited, and modified.

The authoritative terms for the open plugin source are those published for the
QuantFunc plugin at:

    https://www.modelscope.cn/models/QuantFunc/Plugin

